1) INT_MAX<<1 =-2
2) XOR results 1 when there are odd numbers of 1
3) Int range is -2^n-1 to 2^n-1 -1
4) negation of n is -(n+1) applicable for pos and neg and 0 
   ~5 =-6, ~-7=6 , ~0=-1
5) Check Power of 2: (n > 0 && (n & (n - 1)) == 0)
6) Clear lowest set bit: n = n & (n - 1)
7) Get lowest set bit: n & -n
8) Set i-th bit: n | (1 << i)
9) Check i-th bit: (n >> i) & 1